{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act44side_level_act44side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act44side",
  "stageId": "act44side_03",
  "title": "夜逃通告",
  "storyCode": "AT-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "19f581785ba8f4cdc0bc36d2c81b21badfbced5cb0f8fa7c20d67c7851be4a31",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g11_odenstall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神明？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。在我看来，御机大大小小的怪谈，都可以用“神明大人作祟”解释。而我要找的，就是无数神明中的一位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你是不相信的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鬼族多少还是和寺院更亲近些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说，我也很难想象哪位神明大人有那么闲，骑着独轮车诅咒我家房子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，大多数鬼族都像你这么想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你为什么要找“神明大人”？觉得自己被某位神明作祟了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恰恰相反，祂帮过我很大的忙。\n可不知从哪一天开始，祂不见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是刚刚那个“轮入道”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有可能，但我没法确定，毕竟我也看不见那辆独轮车上坐着的神明究竟长什么样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以能不能请你帮我个忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如你追上了祂，甚至......有幸目睹祂的身姿，麻烦帮我确认一下，祂的长相是否与此类似。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "森内从口袋里掏出一串钥匙，上面挂着一枚小小的钥匙扣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "招财猫？这不就是东国菲林照着兽亲的样子刻画出来的吉祥物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我遇见的神明，除了大小，几乎和它别无二致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊小姐，既然你不是幽灵，那你追逐轮入道，想必也是想知道自己的老宅里究竟发生了什么，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "森内老板，我可没对你做过自我介绍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是金石会的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摇头）不是。金石会的人怎么会跑到这里来摆摊呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警方的线人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摇头）那我真是不要命了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情报贩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不点头也不摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，也是，哪个情报贩子会承认自己是干这行的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然是生意，拜托我帮你做事，却只字不提回报，这可不太好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那星熊小姐究竟要什么回报？如果是情报，我可以知无不言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不忙，等我知道自己需要什么情报的时候再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什么说了会惹来杀身之祸的东西吗？这种东西最好提前跟我打好招呼，临时现讲，我可不会答应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，如果你真能帮我找到有用的线索，我没什么不能说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一言为定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一言为定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，接下来我该去哪找那位轮入道？神社？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可别忘了，我们脚下这座城市就叫“南院行在御机大社”，总不至于让我把这里所有的神社都跑一遍吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会呢。知道俗称“结缘的神社”的那一间吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "略有耳闻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，既然你知道得这么清楚，为什么不自己去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神明是很随心所欲的。祂们愿意在一些人面前现身，在另一些人面前却无论如何都不愿被看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来你是“另一类人”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自从那位神明离我而去之后，我就一直是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板！我的电动车坏了，你快帮我修一下，有人在追我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫！怎么是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还在把我当幽灵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来你、你不是幽灵吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香？怎么慌成这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人在追我！我骑着电动车好容易甩掉他们，可骑到这附近车就出故障了，麻烦你帮我修一修！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁在追你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是澪小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪？那我劝你乖乖跟她回去。热量又超标了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是，她是要......要处理我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我家电视晚上突然坏了，放了很多可怕的东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有她和三船先生聊天！他们说——不是处理，就是矿石病！帮帮我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香语无伦次起来。\n森内还没动作，星熊已经走到电动车旁边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "处理？矿石病？萌萌香小姐，你惹到他们了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是发了个帖子，我没想做什么，也不是什么勾结铁斋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勾结铁斋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看这车怎么修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要不还是先追轮入道去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还要装听不懂吗，情报贩子先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说我已经两次吓到这位萌萌香小姐了。现在她有麻烦，我也该做点力所能及的事，就当是还人情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香小姐，我可以保证，只要有我在，你就不会有事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——仁田街那边是不是有人跑过来了！他们是来追我的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金石会的打扮......看样子还真是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板！幽灵小姐！救我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽灵小姐？我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，可我也不知道你叫什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎么说，你的车修好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你骑车，其余的事情交给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幽灵小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凶恶的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1907_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呦，跑到这儿来啦，“萌萌亲”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凶恶的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1907_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乖乖跟我们回去，谁也不会拿你怎么样。听话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪、澪小姐呢？我要问她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凶恶的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在干嘛？跟我们谈条件？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凶恶的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实话告诉你，你要是乖乖的，今天的事我们都可以当没发生过。你要是接着跑，我们可不保证你的漂亮脸蛋上不留伤疤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是先担心担心你们自己吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凶恶的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你算哪根葱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，你先走，我来收拾他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能丢下你一个人啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就把后座交给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凶恶的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（难懂的弹舌）别*东国粗口*在那里虚张声势了，你算什么东西，给我滚开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发动引擎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凶恶的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别想逃，给我*东国粗口*去吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香发动引擎，独角的鬼跳上车后座，黑道的武器挥空，一切都发生在同一瞬间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凶恶的黑道",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1906_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*东国粗口*，放箭，放箭！把那个碍事的鬼和那辆破车都给我射成筛子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么办？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你专心开车，能开多快开多快，其他一切都交给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香根本听不进去，她本来就抽抽搭搭的，这下更是吓得放声哭起来。\n但哭归哭，此后好像确实不再有弩箭飞过来，她身后只剩下金属碰撞的叮当声和人撞在什么东西上的闷响。\n她不知道后面正在发生什么，无论如何也放不下心，只得一边哭一边回过头去——\n弩箭、匕首、扑过来的亡命徒，一切都撞在“幽灵小姐”手里那扇盾上。\n那盾明明也就半人高，可拿在独角的鬼手里，就仿佛车后面立了一堵墙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要转弯了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用担心我。你以前开过这么快吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只在拍电影的时候假装开过但是我没办法我也不想开那么快啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拍电影的时候他们怎么跟你说的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反、反推把，然后压车......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就照这个来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一想到要往转弯的反方向推把，萌萌香哭得更大声了。\n她脑子里已经浮现出推得太狠，自己和“幽灵小姐”一起飞出去，被黑道团团围住的情景——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不管了啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "车身在地上擦出火花，但这个弯毕竟是惊险地转了过去。\n开上直道，萌萌香咬紧嘴唇，死死拧紧加速手柄，强风甚至把她脸上的泪水都刮上了半空中。\n她们身后，追兵的声音渐渐远去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g2_jindastreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要去哪？我护送你过去，然后去神社，帮森内老板处理他拜托我的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "森内老板......拜托你事情了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "追踪我亲眼看见的怪谈，一辆被看不见的什么东西骑着的独轮车。他让我去神社找找看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半夜我睡觉时，这玩意儿出现在我旁边，我一路追着它跑到森内老板的摊前，然后就遇上了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半夜......怪、怪谈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你害怕，接下来我们还是分开走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我跟你去。我家已经回不去了，事务所也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......没地方可去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，只是你别再叫那么大声了，会引来追兵的。嗓子喊哑了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1918_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全没有！我受过发声训练的，哪怕不在舞台上也要好好遵守发声方法，不然嗓子会坏掉的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_136_hsguma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g18_kajistreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "办点事情......带点东西回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是金兵卫让你给我送东西？用不着。你回去，别耽误我工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊的盾，“般若”，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你见过她了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算没见过，前几年也听你唠叨到耳朵起茧子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把那怪里怪气的面具摘下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我戴面具碍你什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "面具不是你去了金兵卫那里之后，他怂恿你戴的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说你喜怒哀乐太过外露，没有立于人上的气度，你只知道在家发脾气，用你那把破木刀划坏家里的纸障子门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说让你挡着自己的表情，你就老老实实地把面具戴上了？知道那面具里可能藏着什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕藏着炸药，哪天把我炸死，也跟你没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滚。带着你的破面具，给我滚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我滚？我滚了，妈怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她？她怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天是我妈的忌日啊，铁斋会长！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你忘得一干二净。你满脑子都是你那重新开张的锻炉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那也不是你跟着金兵卫那条毒蛇一起混的借口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毒蛇？妈为什么死的？妈死的时候，你做了什么，他又做了什么？他要是毒蛇，你算什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闭嘴——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对你的金石会来说，我和我妈到底算什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算了，我们俩本来也没什么好说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去屋里拜一拜妈。你别拦我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铁斋",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三船先生......时隔多年，又出现在电视上了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g15_higashiroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小钢珠打爽了！明天还得去趟神社，今天就......上楼，回家，睡觉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天输了七千五百文，这样一来，到月底我的生活费还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，勉勉强强够活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "够了够了。反正月初就该从铁斋老爷子那里领看店的工资了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要不在乎输钱，小钢珠打起来就是爽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洗漱完毕，开电视，给终端充上电......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "插播新闻？又出什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，怎么是他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "吉星一骨碌从被子里坐起来，目瞪口呆地看着屏幕里那张熟悉的脸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1897_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金兵卫？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "日志、缓存、硬件痕迹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "痕迹清理完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从终端机定位，到信号劫持，再到善后工作，一整套流程下来，花了差不多......两个小时？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该验证的都验证了。播放录像，连接实时监控，现场字幕，全都OK。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中间因为信号波动稍微出了点故障，但都在合理范围内，下次用的时候再加点措施应该也就解决了。完美！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好累啊。好想睡觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然全神贯注两个小时就已经是极限了。好困。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，不能在这儿睡。在金石台的中控室里睡觉，哪怕是员工也会被怀疑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还得回那间又窄又破的办公室去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？临时直播？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1900_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟了！得躲起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的工作人员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1259_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对的，我已经到了。等我调试一下机器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的工作人员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1259_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？不，房间里除了我没人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的工作人员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1259_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的工作人员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1259_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经就位。直播随时可以开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g11_odenstall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪小姐？稀客啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本店最推荐的是竹轮，驮兽筋和羽兽卵也是一绝。要是您夜宵不想吃得太油腻，小店还有白萝卜和昆布结——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "森内，别装傻。萌萌香和青鬼去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哪知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "开个价吧。金石会拿得出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这儿就是个卖关东煮的地方，怎么可能知道客人吃完了想去哪呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "适当的拉扯可以理解，而过分的抗拒意味着不合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "绝对没有，绝对没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是不太理解，一个任你们摆布的艺人罢了，在城里举目无亲的，她能跑哪去？能对你们金石会有什么不利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在从我嘴里套情报吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哪敢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪小姐，您也跟了她挺长时间的了，比我认识她的时间长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她认识我，也只是因为我做的关东煮好吃，外加对城里的怪谈都熟悉，能随口安慰她几句，说实话，我们俩没什么深交。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算这样我也看得出来，她就是个迷迷糊糊，被人推着走，没什么坏心眼的小丫头片子。您和她相处的时间更长，您觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你是执意不肯说了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话不能这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么着，麻烦您帮我美言几句，就说我想着奇货可居，想要个高价，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要是气不顺，先来份关东煮垫垫肚子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竹轮、驮兽筋、羽兽卵、白萝卜、昆布结，一样一份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪小姐，您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你刚才根本就没想请我吃。萌萌香可以吃，我不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪里哪里！就是您以前从来没在我这摊子上吃过东西，我还以为您不愿意赏脸呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪小姐，请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我开动了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她一板一眼地对着食物低头合十，而后拿出纸杯里的竹轮，小口咬了下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好烫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "响彻整个仁田街的嘈杂声音忽然弱了几分。\n连带着街上的人，也像同一棵树上的羽兽一样，在同一个瞬间停止了叽叽喳喳。\n但沉默只持续了不到几秒钟，很快，整齐划一的声音从街上的每一台电视里响了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位御机的市民们，晚上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉占用大家的时间。现在由我，三船光平，为各位带来一则紧急新闻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你老板有多少年没主持节目了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十几年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......歌手、演员，羽生萌萌香小姐，现在下落不明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重复一遍，与敝社长期签约的人气明星，歌手、演员，羽生萌萌香小姐，现在下落不明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "据可靠消息，萌萌香小姐失踪，与城内流传的怪谈密切相关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们尚且无法确定，这一怪谈具体如何与萌萌香小姐的失踪扯上关系，但可以确定的是，事件牵涉到这一怪谈的核心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“金石会的青鬼”“独角之鬼”，这一人物有许多别称。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是一名女性，鬼族，独角，绿色长发，身材高大强壮，据称还带着一面巨大的三角形盾牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在二十年前下落不明，有传言称，她早已身亡，只剩怨灵在深夜的御机街道徘徊，杀死与她相关的人员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先前，在萌萌香小姐的演唱会上，有许多人都目睹了这一人物的出现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于其究竟是活着的本人，是伪装者，还是真正的幽灵，我们尚且不得而知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作为萌萌香小姐签约事务所的负责人，我在此诚恳地请求广大御机市民，为我们提供线索，如有发现，必有重谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香小姐想必也衷心希望各位能为她脱离困境贡献一份力量......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g11_odenstall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就为了......这个？就为了找萌萌香和那个青鬼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她们到底惹到三船什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "与你无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不理解，澪小姐。那小姑娘真的至于让你们老板这么大张旗鼓吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerId": "avg_4199_makiri_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她们至于让三船编一张大网，一张由每个看过电视的人的眼睛组成的大网——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "森内觉得什么东西在自己眼前一闪而过。\n那是一柄短刀。\n在自己绝对反应不过来的一瞬间，短刀插在了关东煮桌台的木板上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果选择不说，那就最好保持完全的沉默，一句废话也不要说。记住这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "御机要是没了你这家关东煮摊，我会觉得可惜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
